{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_143_title", "source_sha256": "7a5576938b24e1558c278ad7e5c914f8221546515b8f524695b3b7229562e1c3", "ja": "私の選択／彼方の希望", "zh": "我的选择／远方的希望", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_143_synopsis", "source_sha256": "bd0ab82be5b00f16ed830dfb4e082a7d7f5be5ed201cf67536d3fdb7c78cadfe", "ja": "番組の撮影で意に添わない内容を求められる\nアイドル達。このみは年長者として我慢する\nも、より過激な内容を要求される。落ち込む\nこのみだったが、プロデューサーや妹との\n会話を経て、自分らしさを取り戻していく。", "zh": "在节目录制中被要求配合不合心意内容的\n偶像们。歌织虽作为年长者选择忍耐，\n却被提出了更为过分的要求。歌织深感沮丧，\n但在与制作人以及妹妹交谈之后，\n逐渐找回了属于自己的风格。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_143_1000_null", "source_sha256": "6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e", "ja": "数日後……", "zh": "过了几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_143_1001_039kon", "source_sha256": "881f2fc7c959b6a7ec5685aea88d4a683e5d3d7ce85b9810a1a378ac26620422", "ja": "かりんったら、遅いわね……。せっかく\n{$P$}が時間作ってくれたのに……。", "zh": "花音真是的，来得好晚啊……好不容易{$P$}才抽出时间……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_143_1002_p", "source_sha256": "fdc7b7af6110854c302aaca5d0b899c47fe82898585f6699fda6733fc33356b8", "ja": "大丈夫ですよ、このみさん。\n……あ、あれ、かりんさんじゃないですか？", "zh": "没关系的，木实姐。\n……啊，那个是不是华凛小姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_143_1003_karin", "source_sha256": "8fd16983cee6a22dbde0decb2fc6039b7e5cc322a2516191b6b88ea5bbd3b860", "ja": "お姉ちゃーん、{$P$}さーん！\nお待たせー！", "zh": "姐姐——，{$P$}先生——！\n让你们久等啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_143_1004_039kon", "source_sha256": "57cd4ece61d1cae4dcea7d87825094ee7f32e07e75a72bfb2350d4d3871aedd7", "ja": "もう！　遅いわよ、かりん！", "zh": "真是的！太慢了啦，花梨！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_143_1005_039kon", "source_sha256": "34fc535334b996b4a76937b2a96581fb08d06a9980b38ddb1115e1c57eebfce3", "ja": "{$P$}が素敵なお店を\n予約してくれたのに、遅刻ギリギリじゃない！", "zh": "明明是{$P$}帮忙预约了这么棒的店，结果却都快迟到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_143_1006_karin", "source_sha256": "fd55c90dd18c85f5c0e6b27aafccb6b1b7760bd2ff0c02e8fa72592768e183a4", "ja": "えっ、そうだったの！？　ごめんなさい！", "zh": "诶，原来是这样！？对不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_143_1007_p", "source_sha256": "f1424d5099b24fa92127938f58bcd18b6bf85baecfac16a687156743c1106be2", "ja": "いえ、少し急げば大丈夫ですよ。\nそれじゃ、行きましょうか。", "zh": "不，稍微赶一下就没问题。\n那么，我们走吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_143_1009_karin", "source_sha256": "1c3516277e2ee4ee84b53eeeb84e24588d9604c8b785810ac8e9b3bdcc5c811e", "ja": "あ、お姉ちゃんの新曲！", "zh": "啊，是姐姐的新歌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_143_1010_039kon", "source_sha256": "b345a846b17abc195634861f87e323256bed5fe6486b24d15d44e7102642a94c", "ja": "え？　……あら、本当。", "zh": "诶？……哎呀，真的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_143_1011_039kon", "source_sha256": "87658aa3e0e1fcb0fde070bc44b2776987e2ce53eb4306d01691bc8890569483", "ja": "……やっぱり、不思議な感じがするわね。\n街中で、自分の歌が聞こえてくるのって。", "zh": "……果然，感觉还是蛮不可思议的呢。\n在街上听到自己的歌什么的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_143_1012_karin", "source_sha256": "ac24cecb270acf2d20114e2a99ffbebe7265b2928b401f256c0747f2a57548b6", "ja": "え、そうなの？　アイドルになったら、\nそれが当たり前なのかと思ってた。", "zh": "诶，是这样吗？我还以为成为偶像后，这些都是理所当然的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_143_1013_039kon", "source_sha256": "81f88dec91dc9ec40f856dab25fefca21eaa8b8a7fb21b377e7c91cfc75d290c", "ja": "そんなわけないでしょ。当たり前になっちゃうくらい、\n有名にでもならない限り……。", "zh": "才不是那样呢。除非变得大红大紫，红到那都成了理所当然……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_143_1014_039kon", "source_sha256": "934cc8960e7732065fca8c0df34e3fb9911c9b2c80ca81dc05dea8f9cd5c12db", "ja": "ね、{$P$}？", "zh": "对吧，{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_143_1015_p", "source_sha256": "338235cbc5a6859a090f46136c23576030d302fde6935a8970daa0fe419d1bd1", "ja": "そうですね。そうしたら、こんな風に\n気軽にランチには行けないかもしれませんね。", "zh": "是啊。那样的话，可能就不能像这样轻松地去吃午饭了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_143_1016_039kon", "source_sha256": "e04b2074d31ad130d97cfd78bc13ae65b95b180f628e075f383700e0a9093377", "ja": "ふふ、確かにね！", "zh": "呵呵，确实呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
